        <item>
            <title>0.10.1</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 12:01:45 +0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>0.10.1</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.10.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in 0.10.1</h2>
<ul>
<li>A folder no longer opens and closes rapidly when your hand rests where it opened — pulling back toward the center still closes it, but only an actual pull does; a still hand never closes a folder</li>
<li>The pill you grab in a folder&#x27;s arrange mode now wiggles as smoothly as its neighbors</li>
<li>A grabbed alternative (the ⌥ face) keeps wiggling in your hand instead of freezing — on both the menu and inside folders</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
